Promoted release: `capture` writes every non-Helm resource it keeps from this
namespace into app/, and `generate` adds app/kustomization.yaml and ks.yaml,
which Flux applies. See scripts/k8s_backup/promote.py (PROMOTE_MARKER).

Deleting this file hands the namespace back to kubernetes/raw/, and Flux then
prunes its objects -- except PVCs and databases, which carry
kustomize.toolkit.fluxcd.io/prune: disabled.
